# Wylie Duke: "Whenever Wylie Duke becomes tapped, you gain 1 life and draw a card" (CR 701.26a, 603.2). On turn 1 Bot1 taps it
# (power 4, enough for Saddle 4) to saddle Seraphic Steed: it becomes tapped as a cost, so Bot1 gains 1 (21) and draws a card (the
# hand goes from 0 to 1). On turn 3 Wylie Duke attacks with vigilance and stays untapped (CR 702.20b), and Seraphic Steed attacks and
# taps: neither triggers it, so Bot1 draws only for its turn and gains only the 2 of the Steed's lifelink (23); Bot2 takes 6.

